title: Reshuffle the Leadership
subtitle: Change the balance on the Central Committee.
card-image: img/cards/shuffle_leadership.svg?v=2
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 6

[? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 0 and dix < 20 : The committee meets every day in the Tauride Palace, between sittings of the Soviet. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 1 and dix < 36 : The committee meets in Petrograd and in Moscow by turns, and never with all its members. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 36 and dix < 96 : Some of the committee are in prison, some at the front and some on the other side of it, and their seats must be filled. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 : The committee co-opts whoever is still free to replace those who are not. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 0 and dix >= 20 : The committee has offices, typists and a budget now, and a seat on it is worth having. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 0 and dix < 20 : The Central Committee of the largest party in Russia has twenty members and twenty opinions. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 1 and dix < 36 : The committee must decide who stays in Moscow and who goes east to the Volga. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 36 and dix < 96 : The committee is scattered between Moscow, the Volga and the prisons, and the members who reach a meeting decide for those who cannot. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 : The committee is in prison. The bureau that stands in for it is in hiding, and must be renewed every time the Cheka finds it. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 0 and dix >= 20 : The committee sends ministers to the government, and must decide whom it can spare. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 0 : The left has its own bureau inside the SR party, and the bureau must be balanced like a committee. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 0 : The new party's committee is small, young and argumentative. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix < 36 : The committee must decide whom to send into the soviets' executive, and whom to keep for the party. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 36 and dix < 96 and lsr_rising = 1 : Since the summer the committee has met in secret, and its members have been arrested and replaced more than once. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 36 and dix < 96 and lsr_rising = 0 : The committee sits in Moscow, watched by the Cheka it once helped to run. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 : The committee is younger than it was, because the old one is in prison or abroad. ?] The Central Committee decides the party's line between congresses, and its balance of currents decides the line. Whom will you promote?

- @defencist: [+ flabel_defencist +].
- @intl: [+ flabel_intl +].
- @rightdef: [+ flabel_rightdef +].
- @unions: [+ flabel_unions +].
- @bund: [+ flabel_bund +].
- @easy_discard

@defencist
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 6, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -2, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -1, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', -1, 1);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', -1, 1);
!}

[+ flabel_defencist +] have a firmer hold on the committee.

@intl
view-if: intl_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 6, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -3, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -1, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', -1, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', -1, 0);
!}

[+ flabel_intl +] have more votes on the committee.

@rightdef
view-if: rightdef_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 6, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -2, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -3, 6);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', -1, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', -1, 0);
!}

[+ flabel_rightdef +] have more seats on the committee, and the left wing is uneasy.

@unions
view-if: unions_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 5, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -2, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -2, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', -1, 0);
!}

[+ flabel_unions +] have a larger say.

@bund
view-if: bund_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 5, -5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -2, 1);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -2, 1);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', -1, 0);
!}

[+ flabel_bund +] have a larger say in the committee.
